# Waking the Beast (battlefield.waking_the_beast_cloister_of_tremors, CloisterOfTremors): the requirement arms of EP_Entrance. Main, a level 75 Warrior with the quest accepted but no
# Rainbow Resonator: the registrant's entryRequirement fails (it needs the resonator): no options, the default. bob, the
# quest completed and no resonator, a registrant too: fails the same way (a completed char is let in only as a helper).
# cat, the resonator and the quest only available: entryRequirement passes (the resonator, as registrant), then BattlefieldQuest's accepted-or-more check fails: the default.
lists CloisterOfTremors/EP_Entrance/onTrigger
char zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.5,-493.9 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.5,-493.9 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.5,-493.9 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.WakingTheBeast accepted
bob: quest OtherAreas.WakingTheBeast completed
cat: keyitem RainbowResonator
login
trigger EP_Entrance                     # accepted, no resonator: no options
bob: login
bob: trigger EP_Entrance                # completed, no resonator, a registrant: no options
cat: login
cat: trigger EP_Entrance                # the resonator, available: no options
